# Stations PDF (current = former V2)

Single button: **Export Stations PDF** on Portfolio → Stations (`exportPortfolioStationsPdf` in `build-unified-v2.cjs`).

## Structure

1. **Front / overview** — official RDG logo (light PNG on dark), chart, week matrix; full landscape page.
2. **Portfolio compare** — up to **3 station families per page**, locations side by side (Ful · Items/staff-hr · Items/person).
3. **Per station** — white **title divider** (dark RDG logo top-right, navy pill with station name, navy footer).
4. **One compare table per station**:
   - **Rows (Y)** = hours once
   - **Columns (X)** = days (Mon…Sun), each with **location sub-columns** (CL / CN / ACG / AWP / MILA)

## Logo assets

- Source: official RDG mark (waves + mountains, RDG, riviera dining group).
- Processed: `assets/rdg-logo-light.png` (white on transparent) and `assets/rdg-logo-dark.png` (navy on transparent).
- Never embed the raw dark-on-black JPEG alone — it reads as a blank black box.
- Rebuild embeds base64 via `RDG_LOGO_LIGHT_DATA_URL` / `RDG_LOGO_DARK_DATA_URL`.

## History

- Former **V1** (one hour×day table per location) was removed; do not bring it back unless the user asks.
